# KWA FEE is a fully reproducible Unity project: a fresh checkout must carry
# every asset, scene, generated mesh/material/prefab, and all ProjectSettings
# (build scenes, render/realtime config, time step). Only Unity's caches and
# per-user editor state stay ignored (above).
!kwaffee/
!kwaffee/Assets/
!kwaffee/Assets/**
!kwaffee/Packages/
!kwaffee/Packages/**
!kwaffee/ProjectSettings/
!kwaffee/ProjectSettings/**
!tools/
!tools/kwafee/
!tools/kwafee/**